{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Peel and place hundreds of stickers in this welcoming sticker craft decoration sim. There\u2019s no timer, no pressured objectives, just a neat pile of sticker sheets and your imagination.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651310/extras/6a938d41cc21b0e0dea9b1a54402aad8.poster.avif?t=1759879157\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651310/extras/6a938d41cc21b0e0dea9b1a54402aad8.webm?t=1759879157\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651310/extras/6a938d41cc21b0e0dea9b1a54402aad8.mp4?t=1759879157\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Pause, Peel, Place</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Begin with a blank space and let your creativity bloom as you bring these corners to life. Chill out to lofi beats as you satisfyingly peel and place old furniture, sleepy animals and trinkets around the room. Uncover secret stickers by experimenting with new combinations and layouts.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Little Scenes, Big Charm</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take your time and get lost in a series of relaxing corners such as a boisterous adventurer\u2019s tavern, a mystical alchemist\u2019s tower and a relaxing winter cabin. Enjoy the chill original soundtrack and let your biggest worry be \u2018now, where exactly does this cauldron go?\u2019. Try some different combinations, who knows what you might find?\u00a0\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Share Little Moments</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorate your workspace with a range of backgrounds and mats and use the in-game screenshot feature to share your creations with the community. Join in the fun on Discord with regular challenges to show 